			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "59d427df-83f3-557b-9f38-0219c1d73f98")
	)
	(text "Port board: up to 0.7 A for up to 200 s (battery port: two hold-closed coils + sensors). TPS26600,\nMODE open: circuit breaker I(CB) 0.851-1.075 A (RILIM 12.1k 1 %), so the hold path never trips it; a shorted\nport board or cable trips only this branch (4 ms, 540 ms retry), and CTRL 0.35 A + 1.08 A stays below the\nSYS +24V eFuse (>= 1.82 A): the control card keeps running. dVdT 100n: 0.86-1.56 V/ms into 5.9 uF.\nFactory UVLO 15 V / OVP 32.6 V; SHDN open. The PTC (0.73 A hold at 60 C) is gone."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 122.33 77.98 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "6ad8fea5-b59d-5dd4-8be9-bec25cd48703")
	)
	(text "Pin map = interfaces.PORT. P_ID: 10.0k from VBIAS. The port board sums its hold readbacks onto ID: decode\ntable (both codes x 9 states, unpowered, open, short; every band >= 8 counts apart) in the pin plan.\nAn unpowered board reads its own band inside the PV-PORT PPB window: firmware decodes it, and in\nhardware VA/VB read <= -181 V and trip (INT-07, asserted)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 77.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "6ba531b8-2337-5be1-a0f8-4bf3eea589c7")
	)
	(text "PORT-BOARD CONNECTOR (PORT CONTRACT)"
